# 统一换行符：脚本必须 LF，否则在 Linux/macOS 上跑不起来
*.sh            text eol=lf
*.py            text eol=lf

# Windows 脚本保留 CRLF
*.bat           text eol=crlf
*.cmd           text eol=crlf
*.ps1           text eol=crlf

# 二进制
*.png           binary
*.jpg           binary
*.jar           binary
*.apk           binary
*.jks           binary
*.keystore      binary

# 让 GitHub 语言统计不要把这些算进去
*.md            linguist-documentation
docs/**         linguist-documentation

# ---- APK 反编译源码树（apk-source/）----
# .smali / .xml 按文本存储（LF），GitHub 可正常浏览与 diff；
# 原生库与二进制资源显式声明为二进制，避免被换行符转换破坏。
*.so            binary
*.bin           binary
*.kotlin_builtins binary
*.arsc          binary
*.pcm           binary
*.p7b           binary
*.pk8           binary
